WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:17.358
"I hope this doesn't fall," Rex said.

2
00:00:17.359 --> 00:00:22.256
He was making a rock tower.

3
00:00:22.257 --> 00:00:26.990
It was getting tall.

4
00:00:26.991 --> 00:00:30.524
Sara ran over.

5
00:00:30.525 --> 00:00:33.128
"Hey, Rex!"

6
00:00:33.129 --> 00:00:35.082
Rex was surprised.

7
00:00:35.083 --> 00:00:39.379
His arm bumped the tower.

8
00:00:39.380 --> 00:00:42.290
The rocks fell.

9
00:00:42.291 --> 00:00:46.187
Rex sighed.

10
00:00:46.188 --> 00:00:50.600
"Sorry, Rex," Sara said.

11
00:00:50.601 --> 00:00:53.816
"Do you want to play a game?"

12
00:00:53.817 --> 00:00:56.569
"No, thanks," Rex said.

13
00:00:56.570 --> 00:00:58.362
"I'm busy."

14
00:00:58.363 --> 00:01:05.582
He stacked the rocks again.

15
00:01:05.583 --> 00:01:08.796
Sara walked around.

16
00:01:08.797 --> 00:01:16.291
"I'm bored," she said.

17
00:01:16.292 --> 00:01:19.685
Sara picked up two seed pods.

18
00:01:19.686 --> 00:01:21.704
She shook them.

19
00:01:21.705 --> 00:01:23.958
Rattle, rattle, rattle.

20
00:01:23.959 --> 00:01:27.122
"Ooh!" Sara smiled.

21
00:01:27.123 --> 00:01:30.438
"I like that sound!"

22
00:01:30.439 --> 00:01:33.223
Sara shook the seed pods again.

23
00:01:33.224 --> 00:01:38.450
Rattle, rattle, rattle.

24
00:01:38.451 --> 00:01:41.635
Rex groaned.

25
00:01:41.636 --> 00:01:46.511
"I can't work on my tower," he thought.

26
00:01:46.512 --> 00:01:50.039
"There's too much noise!"

27
00:01:50.040 --> 00:01:53.794
Rattle, rattle, rattle.

28
00:01:53.795 --> 00:01:59.616
Rex spun around. "Sara, stop!"

29
00:01:59.617 --> 00:02:04.461
The tower fell over.

